Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.41,0:01:02.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ohto Ai...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.48,0:01:10.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you doing in a place like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.75,0:01:13.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Walking.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.35,0:01:15.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This late at night?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.43,0:01:19.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh... a dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.18,0:01:21.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't like dreams?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.99,0:01:23.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Would you prefer reality?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.41,0:01:28.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The first time's free.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.05,0:01:30.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After that, bring your wallet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.46,0:01:32.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How much?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.45,0:01:34.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I know you'll like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.41,0:01:37.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a special capsule machine, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.61,0:01:39.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Special how?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.02,0:01:43.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It has the thing you want in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.39,0:01:46.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't really want anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.40,0:01:59.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.07,0:02:00.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.35,0:02:07.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.31,0:02:35.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It wasn't a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.69,0:02:39.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder if I should keep it cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.11,0:02:45.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But if it's alive, maybe I should warm it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.75,0:02:49.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.21,0:02:57.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, it might end up as a boiled egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.38,0:02:59.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can I crack it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.42,0:03:03.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Actually, {\i0}should{\i1} I crack it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.68,0:03:12.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll drop off my bag. You go on ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.69,0:03:13.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The usual place?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.59,0:03:14.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.61,0:03:17.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai! Your teacher is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.82,0:03:21.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no need to force her to get up, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.20,0:03:24.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just brought this week's printouts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.82,0:03:28.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.\NYou're always so kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.33,0:03:29.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh no, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.99,0:03:33.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder what's in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.99,0:03:33.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm just stopping by to check on her on my way home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.87,0:03:37.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll try going back there tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.10,0:03:55.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.40,0:04:06.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.95,0:04:09.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.96,0:04:22.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What am I doing at school?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.17,0:04:26.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're overdoing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.09,0:04:29.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Any less and she won't get the message.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.01,0:04:31.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In that case, I'll add a bunch more.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.56,0:04:34.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whoa, brutal! Who's overdoing it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.23,0:04:43.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All of you at school today, a question:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.19,0:04:48.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What should you do if someone \Nin your class is being bullied?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.20,0:04:53.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You got it! The right answer is:\NPretend not to see!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.18,0:05:16.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ohto Ai.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.60,0:05:21.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Break the Egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.57,0:05:23.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Egg?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.52,0:05:24.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Wonder Egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.28,0:05:28.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mean this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.65,0:05:29.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Quickly, break it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.87,0:05:33.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But it's so hard, I can't crack it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.66,0:05:34.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Break it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.58,0:05:36.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Break it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.70,0:05:37.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Break it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.33,0:05:41.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.50,0:05:44.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're good at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.51,0:06:33.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn it. Why'd you break it in a place like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.39,0:06:39.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you're done, leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.14,0:06:39.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.90,0:06:45.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did she have to put it like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.44,0:06:47.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hate her attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.36,0:06:49.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just ask normally.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.82,0:06:52.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I said yes, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.38,0:07:09.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stand up!\NOkay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.34,0:07:10.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's run!\NHuh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.97,0:07:18.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.90,0:07:25.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, um, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.90,0:07:25.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We need to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.66,0:07:35.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are they?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.49,0:07:36.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You ought to know!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.49,0:07:39.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're Seeno Evils!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.54,0:07:43.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.66,0:07:44.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.26,0:07:52.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stand up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.09,0:07:53.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.22,0:07:55.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.28,0:08:15.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is this where my liver is?\NAm I going to be okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.41,0:08:18.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.16,0:08:20.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.86,0:08:36.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.48,0:08:49.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a dream.\NA bad dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.44,0:08:50.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Show me your cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.78,0:08:53.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?\NHurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.03,0:08:57.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.49,0:09:00.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mine don't disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.49,0:09:06.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is a dream to you, but to me, it's reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.87,0:09:09.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyway, we'll keep running until the bell rings.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.25,0:09:13.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's nothing to be scared of.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.38,0:09:16.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They only come after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.26,0:09:19.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Plus, you're immortal in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.22,0:09:22.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As long as your eyes and heart are okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.14,0:09:25.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Does that really count as immortal?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.52,0:09:26.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess not.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.69,0:09:29.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, why is this happening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.94,0:09:31.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because you bought the Egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.73,0:09:32.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't {\i1}buy{\i0} it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.86,0:09:34.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They said the first one is free.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.90,0:09:37.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Nothing costs more than a free gift, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.16,0:09:40.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.45,0:09:41.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, you've got no friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.20,0:09:45.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't {\i1}not have{\i0} them; I don't {\i1}need{\i0} them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.91,0:09:47.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.41,0:09:48.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.87,0:09:51.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't have broken the Egg if it were.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.13,0:09:53.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's nothing to be ashamed of.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.46,0:09:55.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't have any either.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.59,0:09:57.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.42,0:09:58.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.92,0:10:01.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess I did have superficial ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.05,0:10:05.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Friends who would chime in,\N"Totally!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.19,0:10:06.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know! Adorable!"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.19,0:10:11.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I didn't have a best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.23,0:10:14.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thinking back on it, best friends matter a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.52,0:10:18.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You break up with boyfriends,\Nbut best friends are forever, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.74,0:10:20.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.74,0:10:23.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You had a boyfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.41,0:10:25.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.53,0:10:27.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I asked first.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.91,0:10:29.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, how about we answer on "go"?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.50,0:10:31.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.25,0:10:34.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ready, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.84,0:10:38.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.88,0:10:40.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Same to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.76,0:10:42.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.22,0:10:43.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.68,0:10:48.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.36,0:11:01.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.78,0:11:03.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why apologize?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.16,0:11:06.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's their fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.37,0:11:10.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.21,0:11:18.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's true. They don't attack me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.63,0:11:23.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They don't... attack me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.44,0:11:41.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.78,0:12:25.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Koito?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.58,0:12:37.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Nagase Koito.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.78,0:12:40.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please be friends with me, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.25,0:12:44.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, Nagase, take the seat next to Ohto.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.92,0:12:45.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.61,0:13:09.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's walk home together.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.57,0:13:10.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.83,0:13:14.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, "Huh"?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.96,0:13:17.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.67,0:13:21.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's nice and quiet here, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.21,0:13:25.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.92,0:13:27.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A game.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.43,0:13:29.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you like games?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.76,0:13:31.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kind of.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.05,0:13:33.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.89,0:13:34.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What game?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.18,0:13:37.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ohto?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.90,0:13:45.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,U-Umm,\NI don't think you should hang out with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.65,0:13:47.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.11,0:13:49.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,B-Because I'm ugly!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.87,0:13:56.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?\NYou're not even a little ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.83,0:13:58.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've got big, round eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.21,0:14:00.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your haircut?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.04,0:14:02.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why do you hide this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.18,0:14:13.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where's your umbrella?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.01,0:14:14.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I forgot it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.35,0:14:16.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And your bag?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.56,0:14:19.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.73,0:14:20.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I forgot it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.23,0:14:23.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.44,0:14:24.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.29,0:14:39.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai, a friend is here to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.29,0:14:43.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's not my friend. I don't have friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.64,0:14:57.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You forgot these. I came to return them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.48,0:15:00.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.48,0:15:11.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's called heterochromia, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.78,0:15:13.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When your irises are different colors.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.86,0:15:15.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's common in cats and dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.78,0:15:20.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's mysterious.\NYou shouldn't hide it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.26,0:15:34.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I get bullied for it.\NAlways.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.10,0:15:44.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.07,0:15:58.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Be my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.87,0:16:05.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's be best friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.21,0:16:07.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.50,0:16:11.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I... want to, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.63,0:16:13.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.59,0:16:18.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If we could, I'd be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.51,0:16:20.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.35,0:16:23.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.48,0:16:28.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because I betrayed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.40,0:16:32.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even though you were the first friend I ever made.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.45,0:16:44.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Koito.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.86,0:17:14.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But... But I almost made it until the bell rang!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.49,0:17:19.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sick of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.70,0:17:26.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.63,0:17:43.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Crosswalks are still scary\Neven when you move with the crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.39,0:17:46.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm done pretending not to see!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.80,0:18:23.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now I'm mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.08,0:18:47.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Saijo Kurumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.28,0:18:48.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ohto Ai.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.79,0:18:52.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai... I guess this is goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.87,0:18:53.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.92,0:18:58.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't forget me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.68,0:19:02.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.93,0:19:04.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Only you get saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.51,0:19:06.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you have to cheer up
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.35,0:19:09.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,if you want your best friend back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.26,0:19:10.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.56,0:19:16.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's a little warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.90,0:19:18.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because I protected Kurumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.49,0:19:24.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, if I protect a bunch more people, \Nwill Koito come back to life?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.74,0:19:26.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She will, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.95,0:19:32.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai! Breakfast is ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.65,0:19:38.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.09,0:19:44.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The weather is lovely today, so don't spend it all in bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.78,0:19:48.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hung up the laundry to dry, so take it in this afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.14,0:19:51.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.14,0:19:52.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, would you look at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.81,0:19:52.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm immortal there, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.35,0:19:55.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have a meeting this morning, so I've got to go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.11,0:19:57.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lunch is...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.94,0:20:02.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What on earth...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.49,0:20:05.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know. I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.66,0:20:08.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe she snuck out last night and...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.41,0:20:09.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please, stay strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.87,0:20:11.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Koito...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.02,0:20:34.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hi there. How are your injuries?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.77,0:20:35.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll manage.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.15,0:20:36.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And your wallet?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.52,0:20:38.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I brought it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.40,0:20:41.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How many rescues to bring Koito back?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.98,0:20:43.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That, I can't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.03,0:20:46.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I protect more at once, will it go that much faster?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.45,0:20:48.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're a greedy idiot, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.66,0:20:52.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you can't protect them, you won't make it either.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.25,0:20:56.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Koito!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.79,0:21:01.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Besides, your enemies won't always be so easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.30,0:21:04.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're just Seeno Evils.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.65,0:21:05.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A disorderly mob.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.42,0:21:08.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.56,0:21:19.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What happened to Kurumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.77,0:21:21.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's just like your best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.69,0:21:24.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's a sculpture in some world.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.28,0:21:27.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And unless her friends go to that \Nworld, she'll stay that way forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.82,0:21:30.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did Kurumi kill herself, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.20,0:21:32.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No comment.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.41,0:21:36.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,♪ No comment. ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.81,0:21:54.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.23,0:21:59.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.\NI'm Acca.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.02,0:22:02.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The one to your left is Ura-Acca.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.06,0:22:04.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.19,0:22:08.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey...\NThere's someone ahead of you.\NWait a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.32,0:22:09.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.28,0:22:15.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, I'm not the only one?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.30,0:22:27.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.17,0:22:29.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.43,0:22:31.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, we're always worried about her—
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.89,0:22:33.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's got an amazing figure!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.68,0:22:34.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.36,0:22:48.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To be continued.
